style="padding-left: 38.33pt;">&#8212;</font></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 69.23%; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; padding-top: 2.25pt; padding-bottom: 4.5pt;"><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 10pt; text-align: left;">Fair value adjustment to equity-method investment upon deconsolidation<font style="padding-left: 3.24pt;"></font></div></td><td class="gutter" style="width: 1.99%; border-bottom: none; font-size: 2pt; padding-top: 2.25pt; padding-bottom: 4.5pt;">&#8203;</td><td class="gutter" style="width: 1.99%; border-bottom: none; font-size: 2pt; padding-top: 2.25pt; padding-bottom: 4.5pt;">&#8203;</td><td style="width: 11.4%; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; padding-top: 2.25pt; padding-bottom: 4.5pt;"><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;"><font style="border-bottom: 3pt double #000000; min-width: 53.33pt;">$</font><font style="padding-left: 20.83pt; border-bottom: 3pt double #000000; min-width: 53.33pt;">33,751</font></div></td><td class="gutter" style="width: 1.99%; border-bottom: none; font-size: 2pt; padding-top: 2.25pt; padding-bottom: 4.5pt;">&#8203;</td><td class="gutter" style="width: 1.99%; border-bottom: none; font-size: 2pt; padding-top: 2.25pt; padding-bottom: 4.5pt;">&#8203;</td><td style="width: 11.39%; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; padding-top: 2.25pt; padding-bottom: 4.5pt;"><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;"><font style="border-bottom: 3pt double #000000; min-width: 53.33pt;">$</font><font style="padding-left: 15.83pt; border-bottom: 3pt double #000000; min-width: 53.33pt;">493,000 </font></div></td></tr><tr><td style="w